  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "“Dafi dw i.” Dafi → Dafi. “Pwy wyt ti?” Dafi → Mali. “Pwy ydy e?” Dafi → e. “Pero ydy e.”",
    "bridge_language": "Use dw i to identify yourself and Pwy wyt ti? to ask one person who they are. Treat Pwy ydy e? and X ydy e as complete identity phrases in this chapter; they do not yet license general focus constructions."
  },
